    "questions": [
      {
        "id": 12894,
        "quiz_id": 2175,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": " People who read for pleasure in their free time have a better imagination than those who prefer to watch TV.  To what extent do you agree or disagree?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UBcEdMAMsox3TbxccD0lP8HBg2c\"><em><strong>People who read for pleasure in their free time have a better imagination than those who prefer to watch TV. </strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QwPydNT4BoDSJmxLIqIlOssUgFc\"><em><strong>To what extent do you agree or disagree?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Reading vs Watching TV</em></p>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1. Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGDQdWiIvohAS0xObhKlh062gjf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bcubdi2aqoX7zmxOWsqltWkRgFb\">\n<ul>\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i Reading vs Watching TV&nbsp;đưa ra một &yacute; kiến l&agrave; \"Người đọc s&aacute;ch giải tr&iacute; trong thời gian rảnh c&oacute; tr&iacute; tưởng tượng tốt hơn người xem TV\", v&agrave; đề b&agrave;i hỏi liệu bạn đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm n&agrave;y.</li>\n<li>Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một chủ đề th&uacute; vị li&ecirc;n quan đến th&oacute;i quen giải tr&iacute; v&agrave; t&aacute;c động của n&oacute; đến khả năng nhận thức. Nhiều người cho rằng đọc s&aacute;ch gi&uacute;p ph&aacute;t triển tr&iacute; tưởng tượng tốt hơn v&igrave; người đọc phải tự vẽ ra c&aacute;c h&igrave;nh ảnh trong đầu. Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, TV cũng c&oacute; thể k&iacute;ch th&iacute;ch tr&iacute; tưởng tượng qua c&aacute;c hiệu ứng h&igrave;nh ảnh v&agrave; &acirc;m thanh. Vấn đề n&agrave;y phản &aacute;nh xu hướng văn h&oacute;a trong việc ti&ecirc;u thụ th&ocirc;ng tin v&agrave; giải tr&iacute; trong x&atilde; hội hiện đại.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaaPdALkUoj39UxqBaClSdzHg7g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2. Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZOO2dHUkAoCdQHxoIXwl6579g8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBi0d80ExoeBwhxVCRWl1GBZgvh\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n c&oacute; thể đồng &yacute; hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề nha. Ở đ&acirc;y, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm 'đồng &yacute;', ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng đọc s&aacute;ch gi&uacute;p ph&aacute;t triển tr&iacute; tưởng tượng tốt hơn xem TV.</li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lập luận theo c&aacute;ch Antithesis (phản đề).</strong></li>\n<li>Để bảo vệ quan điểm 'đồng &yacute;', m&igrave;nh sẽ lập luận bằng c&aacute;ch si&ecirc;u đơn giản nhất c&oacute; thể. M&igrave;nh đồng &yacute; v&igrave; đọc s&aacute;ch k&iacute;ch th&iacute;ch tr&iacute; tưởng tượng nhiều hơn v&agrave; hiệu quả hơn xem TV (vế n&agrave;y m&igrave;nh sẽ viết ở BODY 2).</li>\n<li>Vậy th&igrave; BODY 1 m&igrave;nh viết c&aacute;i g&igrave; đ&acirc;y? M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch của việc xem TV đối với tr&iacute; tưởng tượng, tuy nhi&ecirc;n, m&igrave;nh n&oacute;i những lợi &iacute;ch n&agrave;y kh&ocirc;ng đ&aacute;ng kể bằng lợi &iacute;ch của đọc s&aacute;ch.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6Q8dKUwJolsRLxRHMKlYAGzgPb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 1</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ARYZdTorMo8GHUxXiaxlbgKog9K\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3WzdXi90obr9exqY49ldT5Wg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3vid37FgouPrLxntpAllbSOgpd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ABpydqwzqoBt8mxtA2clX4h8gmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FRtld534aoXQ8Cxcdevl45SsgZc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtESdRTjnoSJwzxYBWkl2MvDgXb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaoQdMKTxottsFx5xHZl5y6dgTe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ShyKdSzwIoav15xhSR1lkgYvgiN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E00JdiJtsoaS4axMnNQltbz6gJe\">M&igrave;nh b&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch của việc xem TV đối với tr&iacute; tưởng tượng.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FTmodcvz2ol3xGxjYGPlbS2Zgkh\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence =&gt; Supporting Idea 1 =&gt; Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J2Mgd651jokGr5xFFcTlMHOagYg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YIkYdyyfZoikZgxMfM9ly4SYghh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mk2zdFhmloeQGbxZgDwlEsvwgnh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JesqdVbvXoysYjxqtf7lyoDSg7c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-S0GAd5xJ8oGcMrxuRAElpmNagXe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-UDQMdQ1laoFTwSxLP6vlLxNcgBh\">Xem TV c&oacute; thể k&iacute;ch th&iacute;ch tr&iacute; tưởng tượng của người xem (<strong>stimulate viewers' imaginations</strong>) trong một số kh&iacute;a cạnh nhất định.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZSGudTTeHoUUbwxmgwvlnevNg0d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Br0HdPtt2o6yaDxssU5lFwBbgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXHedb5Q5o0ChTxzjeJlACIHgBe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qw7XdcQDiopHAmxbaJzlaWDZgjb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EAA1dQKV5otLAmxFGgBlpln2gIe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N5dHdBAjeojWA3xMEbCl8pn1gyB\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-O7EldRD3PoSeXoxw58ZlQ99Ng9b\">TV sử dụng nhiều yếu tố như hiệu ứng đặc biệt (<strong>special effects</strong>), hoạt h&igrave;nh (<strong>animations</strong>) v&agrave; &acirc;m thanh</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-O7EldRD3PoSeXoxw58ZlQ99Ng9b\">&nbsp; ➜ khơi gợi tr&iacute; tưởng tượng của người xem (<strong>spark</strong> <strong>viewers'</strong> <strong>imaginations</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-O7EldRD3PoSeXoxw58ZlQ99Ng9b\">&nbsp; ➜ khuyến kh&iacute;ch họ h&igrave;nh dung ra những bối cảnh hoặc t&igrave;nh huống tương tự (<strong>picture similar settings or scenarios</strong>) trong t&acirc;m tr&iacute;.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJW5dfJhqofjuXxEd7dlCvwzg3b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQSEdv0Y1oIVaoxMMoxljdOvgOd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNQNdCbCpoystuxVP43luHtDgeb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HJ7FdScShoqf2QxHEgylSbaAgyf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NFfDdmOXNoOWwZxiNtZl15SMgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0zKdQFrWoIXtex6mhplQSoegxb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-A4XFdTROHo6SaCxyeChlvrPAgPf\">Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, tr&iacute; tưởng tượng của người xem (<strong>audience&rsquo;s visualizations</strong>) thường bị giới hạn trong những g&igrave; được mi&ecirc;u tả tr&ecirc;n m&agrave;n h&igrave;nh (<strong>depicted on screen</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-A4XFdTROHo6SaCxyeChlvrPAgPf\">&nbsp; ➜ dẫn đến suy nghĩ theo hướng của nh&agrave; sản xuất (<strong>producers' visions</strong>) hơn l&agrave; h&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh suy nghĩ độc lập (<strong>independent thoughts</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-A4XFdTROHo6SaCxyeChlvrPAgPf\">&nbsp; ➜ trải nghiệm tưởng tượng (<strong>imaginative experience</strong>)&nbsp;khi xem TV c&oacute; thể chỉ tho&aacute;ng qua (<strong>fleeting</strong>) v&igrave; c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh TV c&oacute; khung giờ bắt đầu v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c cố định</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-A4XFdTROHo6SaCxyeChlvrPAgPf\">&nbsp; ➜ l&agrave;m gi&aacute;n đoạn qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh s&aacute;ng tạo (<strong>disrupts the creative process</strong>) của người xem.</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-A4XFdTROHo6SaCxyeChlvrPAgPf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 2</strong> </span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FkKtdjQLbo1AtlxkzyalC6VXgEc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZT8dluWuoiebixsy4zlDBdDg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ub8odKVWsohu3TxKHTylRfJ3gqT\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IO0OdZMbkop2KtxaAgbl07P0g3f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ap4ndJ97bocXozxn7oAl3Txmgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwiNdcUNSoCW0UxEnPxlYn1NgYe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lsjlde9EKo9cSdxAvmulNTZPgbd\">M&igrave;nh b&agrave;n về những lợi &iacute;ch lớn hơn của việc đọc s&aacute;ch đối với tr&iacute; tưởng tượng.\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BWa9dLuKzoj7FjxZmWklLufAgrh\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence =&gt; Supporting Idea 1 =&gt; Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZakddQ7nJoAgFyxpFvNleucyg4d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBDmdoEGDoDyBgxNOqylocGigdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PoBydy7ixoRrKIxO5gdlnQbzg7e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FPwwd6a20oL0khxlV17lQP1fgSh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-CLHQd8Vyjoq587xOQKBlr5EDg4b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LSHjdwV06oSTZDxLK19lO20Vg6f\">Đọc s&aacute;ch c&oacute; thể nu&ocirc;i dưỡng tr&iacute; tưởng tượng phong ph&uacute; (<strong>foster a vivid imagination</strong>) hiệu quả hơn th&ocirc;ng qua c&aacute;c qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh tư duy (<strong>mental processes</strong>) v&agrave; phạm vi chủ đề rộng hơn (<strong>broader range of topics</strong>).</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOMmd2z40oU1GpxeAiOljjORg6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IP8udCf4UodaQ1xp6r1lvwiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FWGcdCLrAodR0zx9hxultvvcg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JcusdZSFzovztExclQWl7chLg4e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9rFdK1ipoSiH8x8Lc1lqPoUgYf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZa1dU6WtoYm51x9m3JlC8V6gQe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G35adIotboSlwYxl0TulS1RkgJh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-RUVQdLQs7osq60x8EeLlQfHygig\">Đọc s&aacute;ch đ&ograve;i hỏi nhiều nỗ lực tư duy hơn xem TV</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-RUVQdLQs7osq60x8EeLlQfHygig\">&nbsp; ➜ người đọc phải h&igrave;nh dung v&agrave; chuyển đổi văn bản th&agrave;nh diễn giải c&aacute; nh&acirc;n (<strong>transform written texts into personal interpretations</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-RUVQdLQs7osq60x8EeLlQfHygig\">&nbsp; ➜ th&uacute;c đẩy tư duy s&aacute;ng tạo (<strong>fosters creative thinking</strong>) v&igrave; &iacute;t bị giới hạn về những g&igrave; c&oacute; thể tưởng tượng</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-RUVQdLQs7osq60x8EeLlQfHygig\">&nbsp; ➜ kh&ocirc;ng bị gi&aacute;n đoạn bởi quảng c&aacute;o (<strong>advertisement breaks</strong>) hoặc thời gian cố định như TV</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-RUVQdLQs7osq60x8EeLlQfHygig\">&nbsp; ➜ người đọc c&oacute; thể tự do suy ngẫm v&agrave; thưởng thức s&aacute;ch theo tốc độ ri&ecirc;ng (<strong>at their own pace</strong>).</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">&nbsp;Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZnEdzqc4oEV4wxO5mZluCDFgQd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXimdSddLo8wilxpbXMli5xmgBf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXfQd5foZotNYvxR3yulUfOegnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JKs3d2HFfoJfLcxOlhZlsYPPgOc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVGzda09ioegiAxjp4BlwN6Ugee\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dc96dxi8Do6jiRxbpzIlbykXgw1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JmqrdZshqo5tMExtLg7lIKoMgXv\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">S&aacute;ch cung cấp nội dung đa dạng hơn nhờ chi ph&iacute; sản xuất thấp (<strong>cost-effective production</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JmqrdZshqo5tMExtLg7lIKoMgXv\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ kh&ocirc;ng như nh&agrave; sản xuất TV bị hạn chế bởi ng&acirc;n s&aacute;ch (<strong>budgets</strong>), t&aacute;c giả c&oacute; thể mi&ecirc;u tả (<strong>depict</strong>) bất kỳ chủ đề n&agrave;o một c&aacute;ch chi tiết th&ocirc;ng qua ng&ocirc;n ngữ m&ocirc; tả (<strong>descriptive language</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JmqrdZshqo5tMExtLg7lIKoMgXv\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ mang lại cho người đọc cơ hội để họ thỏa sức tưởng tượng, từ những chuyến phi&ecirc;u lưu (<strong>fantasy adventures</strong>) đến c&aacute;c kh&aacute;i niệm khoa học phức tạp (<strong>sophisticated scientific concepts</strong>).</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 101,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HItKdX2sAosPo1xVt8ZljN7bgF3\">Opinions are divided on whether people who engage in extensive reading exhibit a more developed imagination than those who watch television regularly. <strong>Although TV can indeed be beneficial in some respects, I believe reading books promotes cognitive development in a more significant way.</strong></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12894,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 102,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KxmtdGXcvod3P7x4grLlO22cgtd\"><strong>Granted, watching TV shows and programs may stimulate viewers&rsquo; imaginations.</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"> By incorporating a variety of elements such as special effects, animations, and audio, television can spark viewers' imaginations and encourage them to picture similar settings or scenarios in their minds.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">However, the audience&rsquo;s visualizations are often limited to what is depicted on screen, which can lead viewers to think in ways that align with the producers&rsquo; visions, rather than forming their own independent thoughts. Beyond that, the imaginative experience offered by television can be fleeting because TV shows have fixed start and end times. This limitation disrupts the creative process among viewers, which cannot be easily resumed until the next episode airs.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12894,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 103,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2 ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CEmpd9WSko2df9xQyiul7m9SgMf\"><strong>On the other hand, enjoying books can more effectively foster a vivid imagination through both the mental processes involved and having a broader range of topics.<span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"> </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">The act of reading demands more mental exertion than watching TV, as readers must visualize and transform written texts into their personal interpretations. This process fosters creative thinking as there are few limitations to what people could possibly imagine, a benefit enhanced by the absence of advertisement breaks or fixed showtimes found in TV, allowing readers take time to reflect and enjoy books at their own pace.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Additionally, books offer a wider range of content thanks to their cost-effective production. Unlike TV show producers, who are constrained by budgets, authors have the freedom to depict any subject of interest in great detail, thanks to their use of descriptive language. This offers readers diverse opportunities to imagine virtually anything, from fantasy adventures to sophisticated scientific concepts.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12894,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 104,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EaNLdSul3oogCcxKdrTllSeIgYe\">In conclusion, while televised content has a number of limitations, written texts provide more significant cognitive stimulation. Based on the aforementioned arguments, I contend that those who read for enjoyment have a more comprehensive imagination compared to TV viewers.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12894,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
